  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The period of express consent expires five years from the date of this decision.",
    "Condition : 2 - No advertisement is to be displayed without the permission of the owner of the site or any other person with an interest in the site entitled to grant permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - No advertisement shall be sited or displayed so as \r\n\r\n(a)\tendanger persons using any public highway, railway, waterway, dock, harbour or aerodrome (civil or military);\r\n\r\n(b)\tobscure, or hinder the ready interpretation of, any traffic sign, railway signal or aid to navigation by water or air; or\r\n\r\n(c)\thinder the operation of any device used for the purpose of security or surveillance or for measuring the speed of any vehicle.\r\n",
    "Condition : 4 - Any advertisement displayed, and any site used for the display of advertisements, shall be maintained in a condition that does not impair the visual amenity of the site.",
    "Condition : 5 - Any structure or hoarding erected and used principally for the purpose of displaying advertisements shall be maintained in a condition that does not endanger the public.",
    "Condition : 6 - Where an advertisement is required under these Regulations to be removed, the site shall be left in a condition that does not endanger the public or impair visual amenity.",
    "Condition : 7 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications: Unnumbered location plan, lighting statement\r\nReceived: 31/03/2023\r\nStorage King Heathrow elevation drawings, Storage King Heathrow sign location plan, sign photo visual\r\nReceived: 23/05/2023[insert plan numbers/documents].",
    "Condition : 8 - The intensity of the illumination of the sign shall not exceed 300cd/m2 at any time and shall be below the limit set out in the Institute of Lighting Engineers (ILE) technical note number 5 \"The brightness of illuminated advertisement\"."
  ],
